  "onboardingWifiTitle": "Learn Wörter for each place",
  "onboardingWifiBody": "Lighthouse can use your Wi-Fi Netzwerk name, scrambled on this device, to learn which Wörter your Kind needs in different places like home and school. The name never leaves the tablet, and this is optional.",
